{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-4-6","id":"msg_vrtx_01RrhjeVgpM62W8HMULkmGDE","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Done. Wrote **Q18: Feedback and reinforcement loops — system gets better over time?** (`05-018-feedback-and-reinforcement-loops-system-gets-better-over-tim.md`).\n\nKey content:\n- **Three-cadence loop**: hourly RAG CDC re-index (knowledge), weekly DPO LoRA fine-tune on validated preference pairs (behavior), continuous A/B prompt testing\n- **Signal validation pipeline**: edit-distance filter (>30% token change = strong signal), cohort stratification to avoid power-user bias, MinHash dedup\n- **DPO preference pair construction**: thumbs-up = chosen, thumbs-down/heavy-edit = rejected → weekly LoRA rank-16 fine-tune (~$50/run on 4×A100)\n- **Reward hacking safeguard**: monitor RAGAS Faithfulness independently — if thumbs-up rises but Faithfulness drops, revert immediately\n- **Golden-dataset regression gate**: every model update must pass Faithfulness ≥0.85 before promotion\n- Concrete example: 8-week loop → CSAT 74%→82%, deflection rate 61%→71%\n\n6 items remain in the Next queue (Q19–Q23 + validate)."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":364,"cache_read_input_tokens":68130,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":364,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":1},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"2c46e636-4fce-4dcb-b9c2-743831abd360","uuid":"7ea31c0f-d458-49fe-bbab-e886d850a2e7"}
